      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement the encrypt_payload.py file, I need to choose a concrete external provider for encryption. AWS KMS (Key Management Service) is a widely used service for this purpose. I will use the AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) to interact with AWS KMS. The code will import the Boto3 library, create a KMS client, and use it to encrypt a plaintext payload with a managed key. The AWS KMS key ARN will be used to identify the specific key for encryption. </thinking>\n",
